    "text": "advancemonticellonian.com\nwebsite\nStar City\nBillies get first conference win with 56-28 win over Star City\nBy Jeff Young - Advance Monticellonian,\n15 hours agoThe Monticello Billies travelled to Star City on Friday night as the opponent for the Star City Bulldogs on their Homecoming night. Star City would come into Friday night’s game 0-5 on the year and 0-2 in 8-4A Conference play with the Billies coming in with an overall record of 1-4 and 0-2 in conference play.",
